== About ==
Steffie Nguyen is a liberalist. Since childhood, he had already shown an amazing gift for art. After the war, Steffie saw the rise of Future Horizons in her country and how they pursued artists for a better future. She became a famous rebel, leaving incredible graffiti in the city to laugh at the cowardice. To bring freedom back to this world, she joined Cybernetics, becoming the first non-hacker member.

He has had a long rivalry with impositions, starting with his parents. He rebelled early in his life and has continued to do so. Her life took a difficult turn when she despised the tech giant, Horizon, and was forced to flee or become cannon fodder for her experiments. Moco saved her and soon after found the Mambas, a rebellious force that seems to be her true calling.

Steffie has been and remains a sociable, braggart and wild child who is not afraid to speak her mind and follow the thoughts of her heart. She got lucky when the smartest hacker in the world, Moco, came and saved her from Horizon's clutches after getting into big trouble. Although they are best friends and both yearn to take Horizon down, they chose different paths. While Moco wanted to go it alone, Steffie joined the Mambas and strove to lead the rebel group and take Horizon down by force.

== History ==
Daughter of two scientists who worked for Horizon, she always showed great artistic talent and growing up seeing how Horizon repressed artistic expression to impose her idea of perfection, Steffi generated a rejection before the company and its ideals.

Sometime in his teens he began using graffiti to express his art. On one occasion, Steffie was admiring the last old world mural, which was in a Horizon building, when a drone arrived and covered the mural with paint and marked the building to be demolished. The event irritated Steffie so much that she quickly thought of a way to release her frustration, thought of a couple of radical ideas that could cause more harm than satisfaction, until she looked at a Horizon spectacular that said, "Horizon, serving you since 2000," and the perfect idea came to mind. He climbed on his hoverboard to the spectacular and on it he made a huge graffiti, which replaced the legend with: "Horizon, deceiving you since 2000".

Proudly she came home and on her computer she found causality a forum of people who had been affected by Horizon, in this forum she was already sharing the photo of her newly made mural and full of pride she shared a photo of herself with her face covered, and calling herself "Spray" acknowledged being the author.

The next day, in front of the Horizon building, where the graffiti was located, a crowd of demonstrators had gathered, when they approached they recognized her as Spray and congratulated her for her work, one of them handed her a ripe tomato to throw into the building, Steffi took it and threw it at a high command of the company who was getting out of a car, this high command was his own mother, Mae Nguyen. As soon as Steffi recognized her, she ran out and a couple of guards chased her, evaded the first but the second managed to reach her and make her lose consciousness with a blow to the head.

Steffi woke up in a room tied to a chair with her mouth covered, her mother entered the room and reprimanded her for the mural, told her how important Horizon was to her and Steffi's father and that she should join the company as well. After expressing her discontent, her mother came out and before long, her electronic ties faded and she heard a voice promising to help her.

